# Authenticated MCP server environment (owner-only 0600). Never
# commit a populated copy. Exactly one of the two token sources is
# required; the server refuses to start otherwise (no anonymous mode).
# Static test/operator token:
# MCP_AUTH_TOKEN=
# Or a file re-read on every request (rotation without restart):
MCP_TOKEN_FILE=/var/lib/ocliv-mcp-server/token
# Resource binding written by `ocliv mcp publish --resource-file`:
# the exact public URL this server must advertise. Unset advertises the
# local URL, which fails strict discovery closed.
MCP_RESOURCE_FILE=/var/lib/ocliv-mcp-server/resource.url
